 # app
 
 The example.com/app backend.
+
+## Docker
+
+Build the image from the repository root:
+
+```bash
+docker build -t app-server .
+```
+
+Run the server. It listens on port 8080 inside the container:
+
+```bash
+docker run --rm -p 8080:8080 app-server
+```
+
+Check that it is up:
+
+```bash
+curl http://localhost:8080/healthz
+```
